<title>HONG KONG: Lam Soon to sell property for HK$185 mln.</title>
<headline>Lam Soon to sell property for HK$185 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lam Soon (Hong Kong) Ltd said on Monday its wholly-owned subsidiary Lam Soon Land Ltd had agreed to sell an industrial property in the Kowloon area to Sunny Town Ltd for HK$185 million.</p>
<p>The proceeds would be used to reduce bank borrowings, Lam Soon (Hong Kong) said in a statement.</p>
<p>Dealing in Lam Soon (Hong Kong) shares was suspended on Friday and was due to resume on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
